 okvis_kinematics/.../OkvisPortKinDump.hpp (active only with OKVIS_PORT_KIN_DUMP_DIR, per-kind sampling via
 OKVIS_PORT_KIN_EVERY, call counts printed at exit). Transformation operations, sinc/deltaQ/rightJacobian,
 PinholeCamera project/backProject variants (public entry points wrap renamed *PortImpl bodies) and the
 NCameraSystem::computeOverlaps result are dumped. No numerical effect; record layouts documented in
 okvis_port/c/ok_kin.h and okvis_port/c/ok_cam.h.
